WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:06.690
The Ragnite town occupied by the Empire: Fouzen.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:13.220
With the help of the resistance, we, the militia, infiltrated this town successfully.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.200
Our objectives are: destroying Esen the armed locomotive,

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.970
and liberating those Darcsens who were forced into labor.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.370
Our operation begins now.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.940
I found some interest in you.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:34.570
That's quite an embrace I had. Now, I have to protect you.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.220
Don't make a fool of me!

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.900
Good punch there.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.260
Let me tell you one thing.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.350
Before a woman, I am a soldier of the militia.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.500
Is that so?

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.420
I can smell it.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:54.920
You're more human than anyone else.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.000
What are you saying?

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:01.940
It's time.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.250
Chapter 14

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.250
Choices at Fouzen

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.340
Why do I have to be with this guy?

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:29.560
So you think you've become a good human because of that?

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.990
What bad luck.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.060
Geez.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.120
It's going to start soon.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.430
I'm sorry that you were dragged into this.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:02.830
Don't say that. I wanted to come.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:08.330
As the main force, we'll keep the enemies occupied right here.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:13.820
Hopefully, we can hold out until the other teams finish their missions.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:18.330
With such little numbers, we don't know how effective it'll be.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.570
For that, I've prepared something.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:34.610
From now on, communicate using hand signs.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.490
Infiltrate and kill using knives.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.540
Use the guns only when necessary.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.330
But, if someone fires, then do whatever you want.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:45.210
Let's go.

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.890
Sheesh. It's too quick for me to catch.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.370
You're from the militia, yet you don't know any hand signs?

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.570
I know!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.350
But who can understand your messy hand signs?

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:02.860
Are you truly a soldier?

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.110
You're just a guerilla, yet you're talking so big?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.000
Please.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.080
Don't be a burden to us.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:15.690
You too!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.540
Firstly, extinguish the lights!

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:39.300
We must use the darkness to our advantage!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.120
Got it.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:11.150
Don't worry, we're not enemies. Get out of here, quickly!

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:12.690
Quick!

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:14.970
Come on, hurry!

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:16.190
Everyone, this way!

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.110
How is it? Are you satisfied?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:37.810
They were brought here just because they were Darcsens.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.000
They were forced to perform hard labor every day without rest.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:44.690
They had no rights, they had no personalities, everything was taken away.

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:49.040
When night comes, they're forced into this "pig sty".

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.210
The next day, they labor again.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.230
Open your eyes and take a good look.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:04.570
Come on. Our real mission has just begun.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:17.670
We're being attacked by enemies!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:22.560
It's probably an attack by the resistance.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.670
The scale of their attack is bigger than expected.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:29.260
The enemy strength has not been confirmed.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.150
Oh well.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:35.810
Let them know who the real ruler of Fouzen is.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.430
Alicia!

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:48.990
This will be a long battle, save your bullets.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:50.590
Okay.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:57.120
The operation is going quite smoothly.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:00.250
Yeah, it's still going smooth.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.550
The enemy is in a mess, and our numbers are...

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.540
Flares!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.010
The priority is to find the enemy.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.180
Confirm the enemy's strength.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:15.740
Yes Sir!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:20.890
Well, it's not like they'll have enough power to conquer Fouzen.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:21.920
General Gregor!

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.470
What is it?

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:26.460
The Darcsens in the concentration camp have rioted!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.420
What?

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.530
Other than a small amount of resistance,
the rest seem to be escaping.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.220
So, that was the enemy's objective.

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:35.850
Contact the guards.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.290
Suppress the riots!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.000
Yes Sir!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:40.490
Gallian men,

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:42.300
coming up with this.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.300
Gallia? But the attack this time is...

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:47.440
Are you blind?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.700
How can the resistance carry out such a organized operation?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.330
Yes Sir!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.330
My greatest apologies.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:55.920
Send out the tanks.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:58.620
Overwhelm the enemy with superior firepower!

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:15.510
Open your eyes and take a good look.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:18.460
I don't intend to ignore what I see.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.700
During certain times, at certain places,

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.700
people will do ridiculous things.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.190
Especially during a war.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.260
But, even I...

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:35.490
Target found.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:53.400
Can we really get rid of that monster with this?

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.760
It's impossible to attack it head-on.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:56.750
Huh?

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:58.910
But, if we destroy the tracks,

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:02.790
we can stop the armed locomotive from moving.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.960
Sure, you're right,

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.720
but our objective is to destroy that big thing.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.720
That locomotive might be good at defending its sides,

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.110
but it seems to be weak to attacks from below.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:17.790
In other words...

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:22.390
Yeah. When that big thing passes through here,

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.980
we'll ignite these explosives.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:31.030
Hurry, the attack orders have been passed down.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.440
That was dangerous!

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:38.800
Which squad are you from?!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.140
Hey, what's happening?

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:44.590
Where's our tank?

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:45.280
What?

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:54.170
This is bad, tanks are coming.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.140
If we are fired at from this distance...

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:20.570
That's!

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.410
At such a short distance, there's no way we can miss.

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:24.870
I'm turning.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.960
We're going to cover everyone and face the enemy.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:28.670
Got it!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.290
It's Isara and the rest!

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.290
Looks like things turned out well.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.440
Faldio, let's advance using the tank as our core.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:48.730
All right, that tank is our ally! Don't misfire!

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.560
Understood!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:50.860
Charge!

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:52.940
Right behind!

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:10.790
Alicia!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:20.100
Alicia!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.140
Are you all right?

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.100
Yes, thank you.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:35.140
But do you mind, eh, getting up?

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.050
You're heavy.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:37.960
It's a pity...

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:40.240
I wanted to stay like that for a while more.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.310
There's no response from the 2nd Armor Unit.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.800
What about the progress of the riot suppression?

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:57.940
We should have the edge in terms of fighting strength.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.400
What on earth is happening...

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:00.550
General Gregor.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:01.320
Yes?

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.850
There's a report from the 3rd Defense Squad.

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.800
As you predicted,

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.850
our enemies are people from Gallia.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.730
Do you need to tell me that?

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.250
That's not all.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:16.670
They have confirmed the participation of Squad 7, from the Gallia militia.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.250
Squad 7?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:23.010
Yes Sir, that should be the militia squad which we faced in the Kloden wildwoods.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.880
The situation is worsening.

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:27.080
We need a plan.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:31.840
It's time for Esen to move out!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:32.970
Understood!

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:35.730
Shoot! Don't let any escape!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.770
Run!

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.770
Continue running towards the north!

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:45.820
Everyone, come on!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.730
Give chase! Don't let them escape!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.500
Armored locomotive Esen, move out!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:18.330
Looks like it's coming.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.340
It's enough if Rosie and I stay.

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:22.800
You guys go to the base.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.240
Support Welkin and the rest.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.290
Understood!

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.150
Run!

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:33.570
Come on!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:43.250
This blow...

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.800
...will determine everything.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:51.260
For the sake of Fouzen's freedom!

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:09.760
Now!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:27.770
We got it!

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:28.960
No, not yet.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.450
Only half of the explosives went off.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.440
Hey, wake up!

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:44.840
Damage report?

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.740
The weapon control system is intact.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.540
The movement system suffered light damages.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.450
Then...

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:53.660
Let's go!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.450
Ignite the rest of the explosives, and hit them where it hurts!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.030
To Gallia's Squad 7:

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:04.500
Stop your attacks immediately, and retreat from Fouzen.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.110
Are they mad?

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.900
If you refuse,

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:15.180
we're prepared to bombard the escaping Darcsens.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.830
If you don't retreat immediately,

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:22.670
we'll fire at the Darcsens with our locomotive cannon.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.280
That is all.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:27.150
With that, we should be able to buy some time.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.530
Begin the search.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:32.880
Make sure you pinpoint the location of the surrounding enemies accurately.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.560
Yes Sir!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.660
What crap is that?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:39.240
To save their own lives, they're going to use the citizens as shields?

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:41.580
What should we do, Isara?

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:47.850
Welkin...

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:51.500
What's the matter? Are you hesitating?

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.780
We can't accept the enemy's request,

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:56.820
but is there any other way?

00:15:56.820 --> 00:16:00.150
Why are you hesitating? This is a battlefield!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:03.070
Our foes aren't terrorists, or bandits.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:04.880
It's the Imperial army!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.720
There is a meaning behind this operation.

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:11.820
No matter what reason the Empire may have,

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.510
what they are doing is wrong.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.620
Welkin, are we going to give up like this?

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.280
Come up with some good idea, like you always do!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.140
Hey, if we pretend to retreat,

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:29.950
then sneak attack the armed locomotive with our full force...

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.410
I've thought about that, but...

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:36.180
Ah, since the enemy is at a high location, they have a wide view.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.470
We'll be discovered immediately.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.490
You haven't found them?

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.210
Please give me a moment.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.500
Attack as soon as you do.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.040
Yes Sir!

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.110
Make sure no one gets out alive.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.010
Hey Welkin,

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.450
think of something!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.660
At this rate, everyone will be discovered by the enemy, and we'll be attacked!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.300
There's no time left.

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:01.170
But...

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.020
This is a battlefield!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.980
I'm giving out attack orders.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.940
Everyone attack!

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.340
As expected.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:21.960
Fire the locomotive cannon!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:36.150
Stop it!

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:57.080
I, I won't forgive you!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.660
Rosie!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.570
Let go of me!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:09.310
Idiot! Your death won't change anything!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.210
Shut up! Get your hands off me!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.670
Aim at the bottom! There are leftover explosives!

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:34.200
Intercept!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.280
As if I'll let you!

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:50.440
As expected of Squad 7.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.920
But, don't forget.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:59.680
You sacrificed the Darcsens, sacrificed the innocent citizens...

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:33.360
Why?

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.130
Dammit!

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.400
But...

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:56.810
Even so!

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:07.830
I won't...

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:09.290
...forgive you!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.640
Hi, I'm Jann Walker.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:17.820
It's hard to treat wounds located in places you can't see.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.270
That's what my grandma always said.

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:23.950
But, if we secure them too tightly with bandages,

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.670
it might even delay healing.

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:27.850
Do you understand?

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:30.690
Next time on Valkyria Chronicles,

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:33.390
Chapter 15: The Past of the Singing Princess

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:36.950
Those who make fun of me are idiots who can't appreciate true beauty.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:42.000
Chapter 15

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:42.000
The Past of 
the Singing Princess

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:40.380
I'm the diamond in the mud!
